      "notes": [
        "Transcribed by hand from the two official bracket pages on cifccs.org (linked from https://www.cifccs.org/sports/fh/index, \"Brackets & Results\"). The pages draw a MaxPreps bracket widget client-side (tournament 864e7271-f44e-4a88-acdb-11af2b2f0a37; Division 1 bracket ba9db9fb-2047-42c2-af2d-373b1b738900, Division 2 bracket 24e37e34-2a6a-4c71-96cf-651be5cd0d65), read in headless Chromium on 2026-10-07. Seeds, names and goals are the widget's.",
        "Round dates: the Division 1 widget heads its rounds Nov 5, Nov 8 and Nov 12; the Division 2 widget prints only Nov 12 over its final, and its game links are dated 11-5-2025, 11-8-2025 and 11-12-2025, the same three days.",
        "Both finals match the CCS Field Hockey History PDF (2025: I Los Gatos 3-0 St. Francis at Los Altos HS; II Valley Christian 1-0 Willow Glen at Gilroy HS), which gives the final sites stored here, and the CCS Field Hockey Committee report of 2025-11-20, which congratulates the same two champions.",
        "Willow Glen v Stevenson (Division 2 semifinal) is 1-1 in the bracket, which marks Willow Glen \"(W)\". The game's box score, the bracket's own link (maxpreps.com, game 4e75d107-dbf4-43f9-8f3a-c764da70b9ef), gives the shootout as Willow Glen 2, Stevenson 1."
      ],
