      "notes": [
        "Transcribed by hand from the San Diego Section's \"2025 Championship Brackets\" Google Sheet, linked from https://www.cifsds.org/sports/fh/index (the Open Division, Division I and Division II tabs and their seeding lists), read on 2026-10-07. School names are the sheet's. The sheet writes each score winner first; it is stored here per side.",
        "Two scores in the sheet were turned into dates by the spreadsheet (Canyon Hills v La Jolla, 4/1/2025; Helix Charter v Granite Hills, 2/1/2025); the sheet's CSV export shows them as 4-1 and 2-1, as stored.",
        "Division I and Division II seeds 1-4 had first-round byes. Division II's 11th seed was a play-in, Helix Charter v Granite Hills on Nov 3 (the seeding list's \"Helix Charter HS / Granite Hills HS\").",
        "The Division I quarterfinal Clairemont v Rancho Bernardo was played Thursday, Nov 6 (the sheet: \"Game moved to Thursday, November 6th\").",
        "The sheet names each champion but posts no score for the three finals (each final's score cell holds \"Purchase Tickets\"). The Open and Division I final scores are the Section's Record Book (Field Hockey: Bishop's 3-0 Canyon Hills; Mt. Carmel 2-2, 3-2 in the shootout, over La Costa Canyon, both 11/15/25). Its Division II table stops at 2024, so the Division II final has no score."
      ],
